#. module: mobile_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mobile_connector.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Keamanan"

#. module: mobile_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mobile_connector.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Show the user's Odoo apps and menus in the app (any module, including custom ones). Records open read-only with their action buttons; hide a menu with \"Hide in Mobile App\" in Settings > Technical > Menu Items."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan aplikasi dan menu Odoo milik pengguna di aplikasi (semua modul, termasuk modul kustom). Record dibuka hanya-baca beserta tombol aksinya; sembunyikan menu dengan \"Sembunyikan di aplikasi seluler\" di Pengaturan > Teknis > Item Menu."

#. module: mobile_connector
#. odoo-python
