msgid ""
"Users must unlock the app with Face ID, fingerprint or the phone's passcode (they stay logged in, the password is never stored on the phone)."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna harus membuka kunci aplikasi dengan Face ID, sidik jari, atau kode sandi ponsel (tetap masuk, kata sandi tidak pernah disimpan di ponsel)."

